WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.890
Now we enter the world
of early photography.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.260
The daguerreotype, popular
in the 1840s and 1850s,

3
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.670
was widely believed
to be an unfiltered truth machine.

4
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:16.490
"The camera cannot lie," people said.
Of course, the camera lies all the time.

5
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.550
The background is a curtain.
The context is removed.

6
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:24.200
A chief who is in town negotiating a treaty
is shown instead

7
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.910
as an anonymous figure of "Indianness,"
timeless and abstract.
